/* TPIU_LSR: This indicates the status of the lock control mechanism. This lock prevents accidental writes by code under debug.
              
      Accesses to the extended stimulus port registers are not affected by the lock mechanism. 
      This
              register must always be present although there might not be any lock access control mechanism. 
      The lock
              mechanism, where present and locked, must block write accesses to any control register, except the Lock Access
              Register. 
      For most components this covers all registers except for the Lock Access Register. */             
                                                                                                                                  

